{"text": "The father was very happy to see them, but the woman was angry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon there was even less food than before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This time the woman locked the door, so Hansel could not get pebbles. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next day, Hansel dropped bread crumbs on the path instead. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the birds of the forest ate every crumb. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That night the children could not find the way home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They walked for three days and grew weaker and weaker. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then a pretty white bird sang, and they followed it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It led them to a little house made of bread and cake. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The windows were made of clear sugar. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hansel ate a piece of the roof, and Gretel nibbled at a window.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "f", "a", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "h", "a", "p", "p", "y", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "e", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", "n", "g", "r", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "o", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "l", "e", "s", "s", " ", "f", "o", "o", "d", " ", "t", "h", "a", "n", " ", "b", "e", "f", "o", "r", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "i", "s", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "m", "a", "n", " ", "l", "o", "c", "k", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", ",", " ", "s", "o", " ", "H", "a", "n", "s", "e", "l", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "g", "e", "t", " ", "p", "e", "b", "b", "l", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b"